  "id": "entitlement",
  "term": "entitlement",
  "definition": "Entitlement, in this psychology context, means a belief that one deserves benefits or advantages whether or not they have earned them. It involves expecting special treatment, feeling exempt from ordinary social obligations, and pursuing undeserved resources in self-focused ways, sometimes at others’ expense.",
